 style="width: 25%;" >Total</label><input type="text" id="vTOTAL" name="vTOTAL" value="36" size="40" spellcheck="true" maxlength="40" class="Attribute ExtendedComboNewOption"  style="display:none;text-align:left"   onfocus="gx.evt.onfocus(this, 94,'',false,'0001',0)" onchange=";gx.evt.onchange(this, event)"  onblur=";gx.evt.onblur(this,94);"/><span class="Attribute ExtendedComboNewOption"  id="span_vTOTAL" data-name="span_vTOTAL" data-gx-readonly  data-gx-enabled-id="vTOTAL">36</span></div></td></tr></table></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 SectionGrid GridNoBorderCell HasGridEmpowerer" ><div id="GRIDTABLEWITHPAGINATIONBAR"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="GridContainerDiv" ></div><input type="hidden" name="GridContainerDataV" value='[["&lt;i class=\"fas fa-magnifying-glass\"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;","B1 - Audit Limited Liability Company","&lt;table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=\"border: 0px solid #dddddd; \"&gt;&lt;td style=\"border: 0px solid #dddddd; padding: 12px 12px 12px 0px;\"&gt;TSATR - Audit Services LLC&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=\"border: 0px solid #dddddd; padding: 12px;\"&gt;until 2026&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=\"border: 0px solid #dddddd; \"&gt;&lt;td style=\"border: 0px solid #dddddd; padding: 12px 12px 12px 0px;\"&gt;Ernst &amp; Young LLC&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=\"border: 0px solid #dddddd; padding: 12px;\"&gt;until 2022&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;","Sadovnicheskaya nab., 75, Moscow 115035, Russia"],["&lt;i class=\"fas fa-magnifying-glass\"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;","Baker Tilly TFW LLP","","600 North Bridge Road #05-01, Parkview Square, Singapore 188778"],["&lt;i class=\"fas fa-magnifying-glass\"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;","Crowe Malaysia PLT","","E-2-3 Pusat Komersial Bayu Tasek, Persiaran Southkey 1, Kota Southkey, 80150 Johor Bahru, Johor, Malaysia"],["&lt;i class=\"fas fa-magnifying-glass\"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;","Deloitte &amp; Touche LLP","","6 Shent